WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.004
Rex looked around.

2
00:00:11.005 --> 00:00:19.047
The buddies were in a cave.

3
00:00:19.048 --> 00:00:23.534
He saw some pits.

4
00:00:23.535 --> 00:00:28.294
Rex looked into one pit.

5
00:00:28.295 --> 00:00:31.080
"Paint!" he said.

6
00:00:31.081 --> 00:00:36.763
"I see red paint!"

7
00:00:36.764 --> 00:00:39.205
Tor looked into another pit.

8
00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:42.753
"I see green paint," she said.

9
00:00:42.754 --> 00:00:46.539
"Wow," Sara said.

10
00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:50.546
"All the pits have different colors!"

11
00:00:50.547 --> 00:00:55.157
"This cave is strange," Sid said.

12
00:00:55.158 --> 00:01:00.249
"Let's paint!" Sara said.

13
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:05.006
Sara got blue paint.

14
00:01:05.007 --> 00:01:11.185
She painted some flowers on the wall.

15
00:01:11.186 --> 00:01:17.750
Tor made a painting of her bag.

16
00:01:17.751 --> 00:01:21.257
"It looks great!" she said.

17
00:01:21.258 --> 00:01:24.856
Rex painted a big T. rex.

18
00:01:24.857 --> 00:01:28.914
It had sharp teeth.

19
00:01:28.915 --> 00:01:32.984
"Wow!" Sara said.

20
00:01:32.985 --> 00:01:37.446
"Let me see!" Sid said.

21
00:01:37.447 --> 00:01:40.403
He ran over to Rex and Sara.

22
00:01:40.404 --> 00:01:43.209
His tail swung.

23
00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:46.166
"Sid!" Rex cried.

24
00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:49.161
"Be careful near that pit!"

25
00:01:49.162 --> 00:01:50.568
Splash!

26
00:01:50.569 --> 00:01:54.272
Paint went everywhere!

27
00:01:54.273 --> 00:02:01.190
"Oops!" Sid said.

